cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "PRISMA: open climate forecast verification, starting with Argentina"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "PRISMA contributors"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Open cross-platform project that ingests open weather and climate data,
  verifies forecasts against observations, and shows calibrated
  probabilities instead of single numbers. Starting with Argentina,
  designed to scale globally.
keywords:
  - weather
  - climate
  - forecast verification
  - ensemble
  - open data
